  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Channel Smite</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use Channel Smite, the benefits of the feat apply to one additional attack made before the end of your next turn. In addition, whenever you use Channel Smite, you can activate the ability as an immediate action after you roll for a melee attack but before the result is revealed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/channeling-feats#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
